    "chunk_text": ". Ac him h\u00e6fdon Pene \u00feone weg forseten, \u00fe\u00e6r he ofer \u00feone munt faran sceolde. \u00dea genom Calatinus III hund monna mid him, & on anre diegelre stowe \u00feonemunt oferstag, & \u00fea & \u00fe\u00e6r wear\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t III hund monna ofslagen, ealle buton \u00f0\u00e6m consule anum: he com wund aweg. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Punice gesetton eft \u00feone ealdan Hannibalan \u00fe\u00e6t he mid scipum on Romane wunne. Ac eft \u00fea he \u00f0\u00e6r hergean sceolde, he wear\u00f0 ra\u00f0e gefliemed, & on \u00f0\u00e6m fleame hiene oftyrfdon his \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Atilius se consul aweste Liparum & Melitam, Sicilia iglond. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m foron Romane on Africe mid feower hunde scipa & \u00feritigum. \u00dea sendon hie heora twegen cyningas him ongean, Hannan & Amilcor, mid scipum. & \u00fe\u00e6r wurdon begen geflemed, & Romane genamon on him LXXXIII scipa, & si\u00fe\u00fean hie \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Regulus se consul underfeng Cartaina gewinn. \u00dea he \u00e6st \u00feider mid firde farende w\u00e6s, \u00fea gewicade he neah anre ie, seo w\u00e6s haten Bagrada. \u00dea com of \u00f0\u00e6m w\u00e6tre an n\u00e6dre, seo w\u00e6s ungemetlice micel, & \u00fea men ealle ofslog \u00fee neh \u00f0\u00e6m \u00dea gegaderade Regulus ealle \u00fea scyttan \u00fee on \u00f0\u00e6m f\u00e6relte w\u00e6ron, \u00fe\u00e6t hie mon mid flanum Ac \u00feonne hie mon slog o\u00fe\u00fee sceat, \u00feonne glad hit on \u00fe\u00e6m scyllum, swelce hit w\u00e6re sme\u00f0e isen. \ufffd",
